    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feedback is well appreciated, as I intend to GROW the game over time and add a ton of content and emergent behaviors!</h2><br>70+ Powerups, 20+ Enemy kinds, some with special behaviors.<br><br><strong>Featuring emergent behaviors and build strategies like:</strong><br>- Full Core builds;<br>- Giant Agglomerates;<br>- Full shields build;<br>- Full magnetic builds;<br>- Full aiming builds;<br>- Full directional builds;<br>- Experiment and create hybrids to see what works best for you;<br><br>Pixel Survivor is a hypnotic pixel-based survivor rogue-lite, where you build your contraption by picking up pixel pieces while firing tons of bullets and dodging swarms of enemies.<br><br>During the game, you individually pick and place each new pixel, by moving your malformed creature into it! Each new pixel has a special power and can help you survive the relentless waves of enemies!<br><br>Some blocks are offensive, others are defensive! Some will simply help you define the structure of your abomination!<br><br>After growing a certain amount, you'll be able to get new abilities, and then all over again in an addicting never-ending cycle!<br><br>How much will you survive?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feedback is well appreciated, as I intend to GROW the game over time and add a ton of content and emergent behaviors!</h2><br>70+ Powerups, 20+ Enemy kinds, some with special behaviors.<br><br><strong>Featuring emergent behaviors and build strategies like:</strong><br>- Full Core builds;<br>- Giant Agglomerates;<br>- Full shields build;<br>- Full magnetic builds;<br>- Full aiming builds;<br>- Full directional builds;<br>- Experiment and create hybrids to see what works best for you;<br><br>Pixel Survivor is a hypnotic pixel-based survivor rogue-lite, where you build your contraption by picking up pixel pieces while firing tons of bullets and dodging swarms of enemies.<br><br>During the game, you individually pick and place each new pixel, by moving your malformed creature into it! Each new pixel has a special power and can help you survive the relentless waves of enemies!<br><br>Some blocks are offensive, others are defensive! Some will simply help you define the structure of your abomination!<br><br>After growing a certain amount, you'll be able to get new abilities, and then all over again in an addicting never-ending cycle!<br><br>How much will you survive?",
    "short_description": "A pixel SURVIVOR ROGUE-LITE that will give you a hypnotic addiction! You do all the usual &quot;Survivor&quot; stuff, but this time you'll have to hire a therapist in order to stop playing!",
